+### Regex Abuse Pattern
+**Files Affected**: MarkdownStripper.cs, TemplateEngine.cs, SlugGenerator.cs, LogAnalyzer.cs, CsvParser.cs, ValidationEngine.cs
+**Issue**: Per-call `new Regex()` instantiation and excessive `RegexOptions.Compiled` usage
+**Impact**: 10-100x performance degradation in hot paths
+**Solution**: Use static compiled patterns, `[GeneratedRegex]` (.NET 7+), or regex caching
+
+### String Concatenation Anti-Pattern
+**Files Affected**: All files contain string concatenation in loops
+**Issue**: O(n²) memory allocation pattern
+**Impact**: Exponential slowdown with input size
+**Solution**: Use `StringBuilder`, `string.Join()`, or `string.Create()`
+
+### HttpClient Misuse
+**Files Affected**: NotificationService.cs
+**Issue**: New `HttpClient` per operation
+**Impact**: Socket exhaustion, DNS lookup overhead
+**Solution**: Use `IHttpClientFactory` or static `HttpClient`
+
+### Reflection in Hot Paths
+**Files Affected**: TemplateEngine.cs, EntityMapper.cs
+**Issue**: `GetProperties()`, `SetValue()`, `GetValue()` per operation
+**Impact**: 10-50x slower than direct access
+**Solution**: Cache `PropertyInfo`, use expression trees, or source generators
