+### Missing IEquatable<T> on Structs
+**Files Affected**: UnitFormatter.cs, NotificationService.cs, ValidationEngine.cs
+**Issue**: Boxing occurs in generic collections, reflection-based equality
+**Impact**: Allocation + slower comparison
+**Solution**: Implement `IEquatable<T>` with proper `Equals` and `GetHashCode`
+
+### Unsealed Leaf Classes
+**Files Affected**: Multiple files
+**Issue**: JIT cannot devirtualize method calls
+**Impact**: Virtual call overhead
+**Solution**: Mark leaf classes as `sealed`
